  "details": "A category that weighs your amount of visits/favorites with the time your world has been public. I was thinking something like ranks them by their average daily visits with the weighting of that average being heavier the newer the world is.\n\n It'd give a better spotlight on new worlds that are actually good and give them a chance to fight against the world's in the Hot/Trending categories which take months to cycle out like 20% of what is usually shown there. And then if a world from Rising Stars reaches like top 100 (or whatever number) status in a Hot or trending category, then it's Rising Star tag is removed forever. If it can't keep its position in the hot/trending after that, then thats unfortunate, but it was already given it's chance.",
